{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% block title %}Timeline — Stablecoin Blacklisting{% endblock %}
{#
  This page used to carry its own copy of the freeze timeline, rendered from a
  static SVG baked on 2026-04-20 (199 clusters). The Overview hero superseded
  it: that chart is built at page load from data/events.json, so it tracks the
  dataset instead of a snapshot.

  Nothing in the site linked here, but the page was still built and deployed —
  so anyone reaching /timeline.html was served April 2026 figures against a
  dataset that is now several thousand actions larger. It redirects rather than
  404s because the URL was public from launch and may be linked externally.
#}
{% block head_extra %}
<meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0; url=index.html">
<link rel="canonical" href="index.html">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
{% endblock %}
{% block content %}
<h1>The timeline moved</h1>
<p class="hero-blurb">
  The interactive freeze timeline is now the main chart on the
  <a href="index.html">Overview</a>, where it is built from the live dataset
  rather than a fixed snapshot. You should be redirected automatically.
</p>
{% endblock %}
